    "RFC 8785 (JSON Canonicalization Scheme) vectors and receipt-hash vectors.",
    "THIS FILE IS SHARED: the same bytes live in agent-plugins (enforcer/lib/governor/test/fixtures/jcs-vectors.json)",
    "and enforcer-governance (internal/jcs/testdata/jcs-vectors.json). Change both or neither.",
    "numbers: IEEE 754 bit patterns and their canonical text (RFC 8785 Appendix B); expect null = must be refused.",
    "canonical: JSON text in, canonical text out. invalid: refused by both sides.",
    "invalidText: refused only where JSON TEXT is canonicalised (Go); JSON.parse hides duplicate keys.",
    "receipts: hv 1 = hex(sha256(prev + body)); hv 2 = hex(sha256(\"enforcer-receipt/v2\\n\" + prev + \"\\n\" + JCS(body)))."
